I find it's far too easy to waste really valuable resources by read or
drink testing scrolls and potions. So many of them both rare and much
more effective if they're blessed or cursed -- I'd hate to waste a
scroll of charging in the early game, drink an unblessed potion of
gain ability or read an uncursed scroll of genocide. Even scrolls of
destroy armor have their uses, properly applied.

So, generally, I try to price ID an identify scroll and then get a
stack of them which I can bless. Once that's done, I can usually
identify my entire inventory without much trouble.

